# Brewfile.databases — Database CLI clients.
#
# Installed when `features.databases = true` in chezmoi data.
#
# Postgres-first stack (matches dot_config/claude/personal/CLAUDE.md). Adding
# back `brew "mysql-client"` is one line if a project ever needs it, but
# nothing in the documented workflow does — the canonical pattern for a
# per-project DB is to pin it in that project's devbox.json (e.g.
# `devbox add postgresql_16 redis`) rather than installing globally.
#
# What's here is the "I want a DB shell from any directory" toolkit only.
# Server processes belong per-project (docker, devbox.json, or a managed
# instance).

brew "pgcli"                    # PostgreSQL CLI with auto-complete + syntax highlighting
brew "redis"                    # `redis-cli` plus a local `redis-server` you can run on demand
